{"4421760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divine Orbit", "steam_appid": 4421760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.poster.avif?t=1776954929\" width=1138 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.webm?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.mp4?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Divine Orbit</i> is a high-speed, physics-heavy planetary defense game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You build automated orbital megastructures, warp in heavy fleets, and manually drop nukes to survive endless waves of cosmic horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTILE PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't just watch the grid. Use your mouse to physically grab incoming meteors, hurl them into deep space, or crush enemy drones against the atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD THE GRID</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your defense. Spend population and stability to deploy High-Orbit Railguns, Plasma Gates, Aegis Domes, and Jericho Silos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMAND THE FLEET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When the grid gets overwhelmed, tear open slipspace. Summon Strike Drones, Valkyrie Gunships, and Titan-Class Dreadnoughts directly into the combat zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIGGER GOD POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If the screen fills up, wipe it clean. Trigger Carnage Overdrive, drop orbital Smites, detonate global EMPs, or fire the planet-cracking Omega Cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.poster.avif?t=1776954929\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.webm?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.mp4?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Enemy Types:</strong> Battle cloaked gunships, toxic nebulas, and screen-swallowing Void Leviathans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Game Modes:</strong> Defend Earth, survive a Black Hole's Event Horizon, or manage the thermal meltdown of a Dyson Sphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Meta-Progression:</strong> Farm Stardust to unlock permanent upgrades, new planet skins, and black-market consumables.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.poster.avif?t=1776954929\" width=1138 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.webm?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/7ca58b6080b544e449705f7a3c5042dd.mp4?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Divine Orbit</i> is a high-speed, physics-heavy planetary defense game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You build automated orbital megastructures, warp in heavy fleets, and manually drop nukes to survive endless waves of cosmic horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTILE PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't just watch the grid. Use your mouse to physically grab incoming meteors, hurl them into deep space, or crush enemy drones against the atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD THE GRID</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your defense. Spend population and stability to deploy High-Orbit Railguns, Plasma Gates, Aegis Domes, and Jericho Silos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMAND THE FLEET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When the grid gets overwhelmed, tear open slipspace. Summon Strike Drones, Valkyrie Gunships, and Titan-Class Dreadnoughts directly into the combat zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIGGER GOD POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If the screen fills up, wipe it clean. Trigger Carnage Overdrive, drop orbital Smites, detonate global EMPs, or fire the planet-cracking Omega Cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.poster.avif?t=1776954929\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.webm?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/extras/6452c7d7fe2fef5f349130b7fc26b7f7.mp4?t=1776954929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Enemy Types:</strong> Battle cloaked gunships, toxic nebulas, and screen-swallowing Void Leviathans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Game Modes:</strong> Defend Earth, survive a Black Hole's Event Horizon, or manage the thermal meltdown of a Dyson Sphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Meta-Progression:</strong> Farm Stardust to unlock permanent upgrades, new planet skins, and black-market consumables.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Defend the core from cosmic annihilation. Build massive orbital megastructures, summon heavy gunships, or physically grab meteors and crush alien swarms with your bare mouse. Deep progression, 4 game modes, and absolute chaos.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/6c5781cc582839a7fb0042077ee07b5f3aa97183/header.jpg?t=1776954929", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/598268ebf58f2bc301108e3c888d97f5ea463b99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776954929", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421760/598268ebf58f2bc301108e3c888d97f5ea463b99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776954929", "website": "https://vibeaxis.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Pro